I would not make the central promise:

AI predicts the next candle.

Instead:

AI estimates the probability and expected value of predefined trading opportunities under a detected market regime.

That's a much more defensible engineering problem.

The AI becomes:

Feature interpretation
+
Regime classification
+
Opportunity ranking
+
Probability estimation
+
Anomaly detection

while deterministic components handle:

Market data
Structure
Rules
Risk
Orders
Execution
Reconciliation
